<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Arabic locale resource bundle.

  This file currently mirrors values/strings.xml verbatim. Native Arabic
  translations are deferred per ADR 0009 (2026-05-09 update): an
  unreviewed translation pass risks shipping awkward UI copy in a
  culturally sensitive context (Quran recitation app), and English
  fallback is a more honest signal until a native Arabic-speaking
  translator engages, the web client also localises, or analytics
  surface a meaningful share of users running the app in `ar` locale.

  The bundle ships from PR 1 so the resolver finds the keys; only the
  values change in a future translator-driven PR.
-->
